@TrueCode.Users_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240
@apiToken = dev-api-token

### Регистрация
POST {{TrueCode.Users_HostAddress}}/auth/register
token: {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Иван", "login": "ivan", "password": "secret123" }

### Логин: возвращает access_token и refresh_token
POST {{TrueCode.Users_HostAddress}}/auth/login
token: {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "ivan", "password": "secret123" }

### Обновление пары токенов
POST {{TrueCode.Users_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
token: {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "<refresh_token>" }

### Выход
POST {{TrueCode.Users_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
token: {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "<refresh_token>" }

### Данные для проверки токенов в других сервисах (без токена)
GET {{TrueCode.Users_HostAddress}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

###
GET {{TrueCode.Users_HostAddress}}/.well-known/jwks.json
